UID:FoQWHz1fAoaHSsJ16jBhm
SUMMARY:Sound Bath with Daemein Smith (Prioritizing Peace)
DTSTAMP:20260716T055640Z
DTSTART:20260718T080000Z
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a peaceful morning experience in Hermann Park with 
	a free guided Sound Bath led by Daemein Smith of Prioritizing Peace. Set a
	gainst the natural beauty of the Tsuru Family Terrace in the Commons\, thi
	s immersive meditation experience uses sound and vibration to promote rela
	xation\, mindfulness\, and emotional well-being. Guests are encouraged to 
	slow down\, reset\, and “Prioritize Peace” through a calming journey of so
	und healing in nature. \n Tsuru Family Terrace\n Saturday\, July 18\n 8 – 
	9 a.m.\n Free Community Session \nParking:\nFree parking available across 
	the street from the Commons in Lot S (6215 Main St\, Houston\, TX 77030). 
	Additional street parking available along Main Street. \nGuests are encour
	aged to bring a yoga mat if available. Blankets and pillows are also recom
	mended for additional comfort. All ages and experience levels welcome.\n\n
	https://hermannpark.org/event/sound-bath-with-daemein-smith-prioritizing-p
	eace-4/\n\nFrom Hermann Park Conservancy
URL:https://hermannpark.org/event/sound-bath-with-daemein-smith-prioritizin
	g-peace-4/
LOCATION:The Commons
X-CALRIPPER-SOURCE:hermann-park
CATEGORIES:Hermann Park Conservancy
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DURATION:PT1H
END:VEVENT
